{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body>\n    <p>你是否曾在閱讀外文書籍、異國菜單或面對語言不通的合約時，因不認識的字詞而停滯不前？《Piksi》這款創新的相機字典 App 能提供即時且語境化的字詞解釋，今天更推出終生版限時免費活動，非常適合所有讀者、語言學習者與國際商務人士，讓你在任何情境下都能瞬間掌握文字的奧義。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/460x460bb-75-43.webp\" alt=\"限時免費\">\n    <h2>拍照即時查字詞義</h2>\n    <p>《Piksi》讓手機化身智能相機字典，對準文字即可獲取語境定義、發音與多語言翻譯，支援十餘種語言，助你輕鬆閱讀。應用另提供每日新詞推薦與個人化詞彙庫，運用間隔重複記憶法，有效擴充字彙量，讓學習更高效。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1320x2868bb-20-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1320x2868bb-21-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1320x2868bb-22-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1320x2868bb-23-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1320x2868bb-24-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2064x2752bb-16-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n    <p>Piksi — Scan &amp; Define Words 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後，進入 Settings 選 Upgrade to Pro，看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/IMG_3182-473x1024.webp\" alt=\"IMG 3182\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/IMG_3183-473x1024.webp\" alt=\"IMG 3183\">\n    <ul>\n      <li>應用名稱：Piksi — Scan &amp; Define Words</li>\n      <li>應用類別：Reference</li>\n      <li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n    </ul>\n  </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-08T22:47:34.964725+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":425,"images":9,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}